            </note>
            <note corresp="#d48-f2" n="55" xml:id="d48-f2-content">
                <p>Letter and memorandum from the Polish Government dated September 6, transmitted
                    to the Department in despatch 17985, September 12, from London; none
                    printed.</p>
            </note>
